<title>USA: NY Local Gov't Assistance Corp $385 mln priced.</title>
<headline>NY Local Gov't Assistance Corp $385 mln priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said Tuesday it tentatively priced $385 million of New York Local Government Assistance Corp revenue refunding bonds, Series 1996A, with a top yield of 5.675 percent in 2019.</p>
